Arxic is MIT-licensed.

Arxic ships no vendored upstream code in the repository. Reference collections are
kept in `gears/` locally, fetched on demand via `scripts/fetch-gears.sh`, and are
gitignored. Upstream LICENSE texts and provenance decisions are recorded in
`docs/gears/`.

Third-party notices are tracked via `NOTICE` and `docs/gears/*/PROVENANCE.md`.
